{"text":"大魏正光四年歲次癸卯，九月甲申朔九日，比丘尼法照仰為父母、師僧、十方眾生，敬造彌勒尊像。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"法照","refId":null,"text":"法照","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"十方","refId":null,"text":"十方","start":32,"end":34},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"眾生","start":34,"end":36},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":39,"end":41}]}